WEBVTT

00:00:11.355 --> 00:00:13.035
PHOTOGRAPHER: Hold it, hold it.

00:00:14.475 --> 00:00:16.195
(SPEAKING JAPANESE)

00:00:22.595 --> 00:00:26.435
Michael, I've had a lot of birthdays...
Well, not a lot of birthdays.

00:00:26.515 --> 00:00:28.835
But this is the best birthday ever.

00:00:30.675 --> 00:00:31.995
What are you looking at?

00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:35.155
I was just thinking about
the first time I laid eye on you,

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.715
-how pretty you looked.
-Stop it.

00:00:37.795 --> 00:00:41.515
-Your hair was shorter.
-I'm thinking about getting it cut.

00:00:41.595 --> 00:00:43.515
No, no, I like it this length.

00:00:43.755 --> 00:00:45.115
I like everything about you.

00:00:45.635 --> 00:00:49.995
Just the other day someone asked
who was the most beautiful monster.

00:00:50.075 --> 00:00:52.235
-You know what I said?
-What did you say?

00:00:52.315 --> 00:00:53.315
I said...

00:00:54.155 --> 00:00:55.795
-Sulley?
-Sulley?

00:00:55.835 --> 00:00:58.155
No, no, that's not what
I was gonna say.

00:00:58.315 --> 00:00:59.635
You're not making sense.

00:00:59.755 --> 00:01:03.635
-He's handsome. He's rugged.
-What a coincidence, running into you.

00:01:03.835 --> 00:01:06.195
-I'm just gonna order something.
-CELIA: Michael.

00:01:06.475 --> 00:01:08.955
-What's good?
-You're ruining everything.

00:01:08.995 --> 00:01:11.315
I went to get your paperwork
and there was a door.

00:01:11.395 --> 00:01:12.435
What?

00:01:14.315 --> 00:01:15.355
(RATTLING)

00:01:15.435 --> 00:01:17.195
-A door?
-Randall was in it.

00:01:17.275 --> 00:01:20.835
Randall? That cheater.
He's trying to boost his numbers.

00:01:20.875 --> 00:01:22.555
-There's something else.
-What?

00:01:22.635 --> 00:01:24.675
Ooklay in the agbay.

00:01:24.995 --> 00:01:26.875
-What?
-Look in the bag.

00:01:27.835 --> 00:01:28.835
What bag?

00:01:28.915 --> 00:01:30.075
(SIGHS)

00:01:32.035 --> 00:01:33.035
(GASPS)

00:01:34.155 --> 00:01:35.835
(GIGGLING)

00:01:36.835 --> 00:01:40.235
They don't have anything
I like here. Take care, Celia.

00:01:40.355 --> 00:01:43.595
-What's going on?
-Celia, please try to understand.

00:01:43.835 --> 00:01:46.715
-I have to do something!
-Michael?

00:01:47.755 --> 00:01:49.595
On three. One, two...

00:01:49.675 --> 00:01:50.715
(SQUEALS AND GIGGLES)

00:01:53.715 --> 00:01:54.715
-A kid!
-Boo!

00:01:55.195 --> 00:01:56.555
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:01:59.515 --> 00:02:00.675
A kid!

00:02:02.395 --> 00:02:04.555
There's a kid here.
A human kid!

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:09.995
Googly bear!

00:02:16.395 --> 00:02:17.435
Come on.

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:23.475
Let's get out of here.

00:02:23.835 --> 00:02:26.515
CDA HELICOPTER PILOT:
Please remain calm. This is not a drill.

00:02:26.555 --> 00:02:27.915
(SIREN WAILING)

00:02:29.635 --> 00:02:31.555
CDA AGENT: 7835 in progress,
please advise.

00:02:32.315 --> 00:02:34.995
-Michael? Michael!
-Celia!

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:36.635
-CDA AGENT: Come with me.
-Stop pushing.

00:02:36.715 --> 00:02:38.635
Get your hands off
my schmoopsie-pooh.

00:02:39.715 --> 00:02:40.955
Ready for decontamination.

00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:43.755
I don't think that date
could have gone any worse.

00:02:51.795 --> 00:02:54.835
If witnesses are to be believed,
there has been a child security breach

00:02:54.915 --> 00:02:57.235
for the first time in monster history.

00:02:57.275 --> 00:03:00.755
We neither confirm nor deny
the presence of a human child here.

00:03:00.835 --> 00:03:05.075
Well, a kid flew right over me and
blasted a car with its laser vision.

00:03:05.155 --> 00:03:08.395
I tried to run, but it picked me up
with its mind powers

00:03:08.435 --> 00:03:09.755
and shook me like a doll.

00:03:09.835 --> 00:03:11.875
It's true.
I saw the whole thing.

00:03:12.115 --> 00:03:17.275
It is my professional opinion
that now is the time to panic.

00:03:17.955 --> 00:03:18.875
Oh-oh.

00:03:19.115 --> 00:03:20.475
(BOTH YELLING)

00:03:22.075 --> 00:03:23.635
It's coming. It's coming!

00:03:24.955 --> 00:03:26.075
BOO: Boo!

00:03:32.715 --> 00:03:34.435
MIKE: No, no, no, no!

00:03:34.995 --> 00:03:36.395
Come here, kid.

00:03:39.235 --> 00:03:41.155
Don't touch those, you little...

00:03:41.235 --> 00:03:43.635
Those were alphabetized.
It's OK.

00:03:43.675 --> 00:03:46.715
As long as it doesn't come near us
we're gonna be OK.

00:03:46.795 --> 00:03:47.835
(SNEEZES)

00:03:56.875 --> 00:03:58.995
You like this? Fetch.

00:04:01.315 --> 00:04:04.275
Hey, hey. That's it.
No one touches Little Mikey.

00:04:05.155 --> 00:04:06.675
(WHINING)

00:04:06.995 --> 00:04:08.675
Mike, give her the bear.

00:04:10.435 --> 00:04:11.955
Oh, no!

00:04:11.995 --> 00:04:13.355
(PIERCING SCREAM)

00:04:26.435 --> 00:04:28.355
Make it stop, Sulley.
Make it stop!

00:04:28.435 --> 00:04:31.515
Here, look. See bear?
Nice bear.

00:04:32.035 --> 00:04:33.115
Sulley!

00:04:34.355 --> 00:04:37.115
Bear, he's a happy bear.

00:04:37.195 --> 00:04:40.035
He's not crying, neither should you.
We'll be in trouble

00:04:40.115 --> 00:04:43.515
'cause they're gonna find us,
so please stop crying now.

00:04:44.115 --> 00:04:46.675
Good. Good, Sulley. Keep it up.
You're doing great.

00:04:46.715 --> 00:04:48.035
He's a happy bear.
He has no...

00:04:48.075 --> 00:04:49.715
(SCREAMING)

00:04:49.955 --> 00:04:52.195
-It touched me.
-Sulley, the bear!

00:04:52.555 --> 00:04:54.155
The bear. Give her the...

00:04:58.315 --> 00:04:59.715
(GIGGLES)

00:05:03.795 --> 00:05:05.235
(GIGGLES)

00:05:05.395 --> 00:05:07.235
What was that?

00:05:07.275 --> 00:05:12.395
I have no idea, but it would be
really great if it didn't do it again.

00:05:13.755 --> 00:05:15.155
(SHUSHING)

00:05:15.235 --> 00:05:16.355
Shh!

00:05:28.275 --> 00:05:29.275
Ah!

00:05:33.395 --> 00:05:35.755
How could I do this?
How could I be so stupid?

00:05:35.955 --> 00:05:39.435
-This could destroy the company.
-Who cares about the company?

00:05:39.475 --> 00:05:42.555
What about us?
That thing is a killing machine.

00:05:44.075 --> 00:05:47.315
It's waiting for us to fall asleep
and then wham!

00:05:47.795 --> 00:05:50.875
We're easy prey, my friend.
We're sitting targets.

00:05:51.595 --> 00:05:53.755
OK, look, I think I have a plan here.

00:05:53.835 --> 00:05:57.155
Using mainly spoons,
we dig a tunnel under the city

00:05:57.235 --> 00:05:59.435
and release it into the wild.

00:05:59.835 --> 00:06:01.075
Spoons.

00:06:02.195 --> 00:06:05.435
That's it. I'm out of ideas.
Air balloon, too expensive.

00:06:05.515 --> 00:06:08.475
Giant slingshot, too conspicuous.
Enormous wooden horse, too Greek.

00:06:09.795 --> 00:06:11.795
(SPEAKING BABY TALK)

00:06:12.195 --> 00:06:15.275
MIKE: No. Can't think. Can't think.

00:06:15.355 --> 00:06:16.315
(SIGHS)

00:06:16.435 --> 00:06:18.555
-Flatliner. Flatlining.
-Mike?

00:06:18.875 --> 00:06:20.995
I think she's getting tired.

00:06:21.315 --> 00:06:24.955
Well, then why don't you
find someplace for it to sleep

00:06:25.155 --> 00:06:27.235
while I think of a plan!

00:06:29.275 --> 00:06:32.075
Are you sleepy? Wanna sleep?

00:06:32.235 --> 00:06:33.315
Is that what you want?

00:06:47.995 --> 00:06:50.915
OK. I'll make a nice little area
for you to...

00:06:50.995 --> 00:06:54.195
No. Hey, that's my bed.
You're gonna get your germs all over it.

00:06:57.355 --> 00:06:59.795
(SIGHS) Fine.
My chair's more comfortable anyway.

00:06:59.835 --> 00:07:01.515
(YELLS)

00:07:01.595 --> 00:07:03.115
What?

00:07:05.355 --> 00:07:07.435
It's just a closet.
Will you go to sleep?

00:07:11.355 --> 00:07:13.195
Hey, that looks like Randall.

00:07:14.115 --> 00:07:15.675
Randall's your monster.

00:07:16.515 --> 00:07:19.155
You think he's gonna
come through the closet and scare you.

00:07:19.195 --> 00:07:21.195
Oh, boy, how do I explain this?

00:07:21.235 --> 00:07:22.595
It's empty.

00:07:22.915 --> 00:07:24.115
See?

00:07:24.635 --> 00:07:26.115
No monster in here.

00:07:29.875 --> 00:07:31.195
Well, now there is.

00:07:31.235 --> 00:07:33.355
But I'm not gonna scare you.

00:07:34.075 --> 00:07:35.115
I'm off duty.

00:07:39.355 --> 00:07:40.395
OK.

00:07:40.875 --> 00:07:44.915
How about I sit here
until you fall asleep?

00:07:46.915 --> 00:07:49.035
Go ahead. Go to sleep.

00:07:50.115 --> 00:07:52.635
Now. Now go.

00:07:53.875 --> 00:07:58.075
You go to sleep.

00:07:58.315 --> 00:08:00.235
(IMITATING SNORING)

00:08:05.675 --> 00:08:06.635
(SIGHS IN RELIEF)

